{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0ac6d6b952da8cf5","name":"Enforcement Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-0ac6d6b952da8cf5","title":"Enforcement Talent Tree","revision":26769,"timestamp":"2025-07-21T18:50:13Z","sha256":"0ab85a3ab4744f9ae71d0ee22d5b6a404603bf3c9a81c3261500b93d829b2aec","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26769","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Enforcement%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0ac6d6b952da8cf5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a trained investigator who can locate and apprehend a quarry with exceptional speed and prowess.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cover Bracing"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brace"}," a weapon set on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," as a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," (instead of two) if you are adjacent to an object (including walls, barriers, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},") that provides you with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," from all of the target squares.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Intentional Crash"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to intentionally crash an opponent's moving ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},". When you successfully deal damage to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ramming"}," it, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes half damage from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ram","referenceId":"reference:76e11af94d353c6e"},". Additionally, if the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," is the same size as your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or smaller, that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," in the following round.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Nonlethal Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you are using a ranged weapon set to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nets"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nets"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Batons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Batons"},", you gain a +1 bonus on your attack roll and deal +1 die of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Damage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Damage","referenceId":"reference:85e4b3c26dc13486"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Pursuit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When ",{"tag":"a","children":["Running"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Running"},", you are not restricted to a straight line; and you can reroll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," checks, keeping the better of the two results, while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Running"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Running"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Respected Officer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have a reputation that causes allies and opponents to treat you with respect. You automatically improve the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Indifferent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Indifferent"}," character to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Friendly"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Friendly"}," with no check required.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Slowing Stun"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you move a target at least -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," with an attack, its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is halved until all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conditions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conditions","referenceId":"reference:97d4be8960698f97"}," are removed.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Takedown"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," and deal damage at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},", you knock your target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," as well, provided your opponent is no more than one size category larger than you.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
